From: Kernel maintenance <maintenance@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] tracing: own read page sizes across concurrent subbuffer resize

Backport the complete allocator/read/splice ownership contract. Retain the
6.18 rb_init_page, mapped and CONFIG_TRACER_MAX_TRACE paths. The local
ftrace_buffer_info definition resides in trace.c. Also use the allocation's
size in the benchmark caller. Existing mmap resize exclusion is retained.

CVE: CVE-2026-98032
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dae8dda341d2d9034a90d59e8a7d502e1263813f]

